  "details": "Please consider bringing native macOS support to VRChat.\n\nWith the introduction of Apple Silicon (M1/M2/M3/M4 chips) and Apple's Game Porting Toolkit, Mac devices now have excellent performance and graphic capabilities. Many Mac users in the community want to join VRChat without having to rely on Bootcamp, Cloud Gaming, or complex workarounds.\n\nAdding macOS support would greatly expand the player base and allow friends on Mac to hang out together in VRChat. Thank you for considering this request!",
